        "titolo_orig": "Michigan Senate candidate El-Sayed declines to disavow Hasan Piker’s past comments",
        "testo_it": "Il candidato democratico al Senato in Michigan, Abdul El-Sayed, difende lo streamer Hasan Piker.",
        "priorita": "Bassa",
